{"beat": 13, "name": "THE RING", "text": "The next thing changed manufacturing. Because the price was fixed, the only way to sell something new was to make it cost less, and Woolworth's buyers went to manufacturers and showed them how. Here's one, as Woolworth himself told it to the trade paper Printers' Ink. A finger ring sold at retail for around 50 cents. Its maker had sold more than 450 dozen so far that year. A Woolworth buyer offered to take 5,000 gross over the next year. That's 720,000 rings. And he came with suggestions for making it cheaper. The result: ten-cent gold-filled rings. The price came first. The product was redesigned to meet it.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "The", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14}, {"word": "next", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.3}, {"word": "thing", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.56}, {"word": "changed", "start": 0.56, "end": 1.06}, {"word": "manufacturing.", "start": 1.06, "end": 1.76}, {"word": "Because", "start": 2.48, "end": 2.78}, {"word": "the", "start": 2.78, "end": 2.98}, {"word": "price", "start": 2.98, "end": 3.3}, {"word": "was", "start": 3.3, "end": 3.5}, {"word": "fixed,", "start": 3.5, "end": 3.86}, {"word": "the", "start": 4.36, "end": 4.46}, {"word": "only", "start": 4.46, "end": 4.82}, {"word": "way", "start": 4.82, "end": 5.04}, {"word": "to", "start": 5.04, "end": 5.22}, {"word": "sell", "start": 5.22, "end": 5.48}, {"word": "something", "start": 5.48, "end": 5.8}, {"word": "new", "start": 5.8, "end": 6.16}, {"word": "was", "start": 6.16, "end": 6.42}, {"word": "to", "start": 6.42, "end": 6.56}, {"word": "make", "start": 6.56, "end": 6.76}, {"word": "it", "start": 6.76, "end": 6.88}, {"word": "cost", "start": 6.88, "end": 7.16}, {"word": "less,", "start": 7.16, "end": 7.56}, {"word": "and", "start": 8.06, "end": 8.24}, {"word": "Woolworth's", "start": 8.24, "end": 8.92}, {"word": "buyers", "start": 8.92, "end": 9.16}, {"word": "went", "start": 9.16, "end": 9.5}, {"word": "to", "start": 9.5, "end": 9.68}, {"word